# Local development environment for pipeline/.venv.
#
# CI does NOT use this file. The hash-locked requirements.txt /
# requirements-publish.txt are compiled for linux x86_64 (see the uv command in
# their headers), so they cannot be installed on a developer's macOS/arm64
# machine at all. Those locks stay the security-relevant contract for the jobs
# that actually publish; this file is the local mirror of the render surface,
# version-pinned via requirements.in but not hash-verified, because the hashes
# are platform-specific and CI owns them.
-r requirements.in

# Sample-tool only: pipeline/tools/make_sample_overlay.py reprojects with
# pyproj.Transformer. Deliberately NOT in requirements.in - the render and
# publish environments must not grow a dependency only a dev tool needs.
pyproj==3.7.2
